# Test Automation Configuration

This file shows example environment variables for running tests.
Copy to `.env` and modify values as needed.

```bash
# Application executable path (optional, defaults to local installation)
APP_PATH=C:\Users\offic\AppData\Local\Programs\photostrip-webcam\Photostrip by Potokita - Webcam.exe

# Phone number for test (optional, defaults to 085335073597)
PHONE=085335073597

# Voucher code for test (optional, defaults to #0909)
VOUCHER=#0909

# Number of retakes to perform during test (optional, defaults to 0)
RETAKE_TIMES=0
```

## Environment Variables

| Variable | Default | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `APP_PATH` | `C:\Users\offic\AppData\Local\Programs\photostrip-webcam\Photostrip by Potokita - Webcam.exe` | Path to Electron app executable |
| `PHONE` | `085335073597` | Phone number to use during test |
| `VOUCHER` | `#0909` | Voucher code to apply |
| `RETAKE_TIMES` | `0` | Number of times to retake photos |

## Usage Examples

```bash
# Use defaults
npm run test:nw

# Override phone number
PHONE=085123456789 npm run test:nw

# Override voucher
VOUCHER=#1234 npm run test:nw

# Set retakes
RETAKE_TIMES=3 npm run test:nw

# Combine multiple overrides
PHONE=085123456789 VOUCHER=#1234 RETAKE_TIMES=2 npm run test:nw
```
